! wB97X-D3 def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Transition-dipole basis convergence, 44-atom anionic QM region in the full
# protein/solvent point-charge field. |mu| from the spectroscopically normalised
# STEOM density is 9.6 D; extinction and Strickler-Berg give 7.5-7.9 D. Since
# J ~ |mu|^2 that is a 48% lever on the coupling and 2.3x on the CD rotational
# strength, so this sweep tests whether the discrepancy is a basis artefact.
%maxcore 3500
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field.pc"
%tddft
  NRoots 5
  TDA false
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_cthrp.xyz
